{"name":"Highlander","hex":"#3a533d","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Highlander","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A person from the Highlands."]},{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A surname from German."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Highlander"}],"entries":[{"title":"Highlander (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Highlander is a 1986 fantasy action-adventure film and the first installment in the Highlander franchise. It follows Connor MacLeod, a Scottish Highlander who discovers he is immortal and, after centuries of clandestine duels, confronts his ultimate rival in contemporary New York. It stars Christopher Lambert as MacLeod and also features Roxanne Hart, Clancy Brown, and Sean Connery. It is directed by Russell Mulcahy from a screenplay by Gregory Widen, Peter Bellwood, and Larry Ferguson."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/b/bc/Highlander_1986%2Cposter.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Highlander_(film)","wikidata":"Q156539"},{"title":"Highlander (upcoming film)","blocks":[{"text":"Highlander is an upcoming American fantasy action film directed by Chad Stahelski, written by Kerry Williamson and Mike Finch, and starring Henry Cavill, Russell Crowe, Marisa Abela, Dave Bautista, Karen Gillan, Djimon Hounsou, Drew McIntyre, and Jeremy Irons. It is a reboot of the film franchise of the same name."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Highlander_(upcoming_film)","wikidata":"Q123346839"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/b/bc/Highlander_1986%2Cposter.jpg/250px-Highlander_1986%2Cposter.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/b/bc/Highlander_1986%2Cposter.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/b/bc